---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact Stayput: email, bugs and tool requests" description="Email Stayput, report a bug or ask for a new tool. Your files stay in your browser, so please don't attach private files.">
  <article class="wrap-narrow prose page">
    <h1>Contact Stayput</h1>
    <p>Stayput is a small, open-source project. Here is how to reach us.</p>
    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>Write to <a href="mailto:hello@stayput.dev">hello@stayput.dev</a> for questions, press or anything that does not belong in a public issue.</p>
    <h2>Bug reports and tool requests</h2>
    <p>Found something broken, or want a tool that is not here yet? <a href="https://github.com/keenanlk/stayput/issues" rel="noopener">Open an issue on GitHub</a>. Say which tool and which browser you used, and what you expected to happen.</p>
    <h2>Please don't attach private files</h2>
    <p>Your files never leave your browser, and we have no way to see them. So please don't attach private files when you email. If a file triggers a bug, a small sample that contains nothing personal is plenty.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
